{"version":1,"key":"card:439","content":{"id":439,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"2d2e64ca-6bf1-486c-8ed5-337e8cc98100","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"元组：不可修改的序列。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"1415607f-236f-4f26-b1d8-b71a6392157d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"元组使用逗号分隔即可创建。还可以使用圆括号括起（常用做法）。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"b06ad7b0-601d-40d5-afe0-fc8128b78425","collabId":"cb80e4b4-0686-4cf7-80c9-e9cb34f6792c","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> 1, 2, 3\n(1, 2, 3)\n>>> (1, 2, 3)\n(1, 2, 3)"},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"warning","title":"注意","collabId":"0993e3bb-fe65-4c9f-bae1-5f8b31b13f0b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"e046fac7-d5b6-42af-8888-c0f93151130b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"只包含一个值的元组，虽然只有一个值，也必须在它后面加上逗号。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"617ccd71-7113-462a-8edb-147aa30d5a7a","collabId":"af862e9f-d022-47a4-b18a-666de589b65e","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> (42,)\n(42,)"},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"90f519be-b027-4b43-92d7-292bb6618e19","collabId":"48db9fed-a263-43ed-a8b8-bcb16d1917fd","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> 3 * (40 + 2)\n126\n>>> 3 * (40 + 2,)\n(42, 42, 42)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"e99f2358-7bd3-4af8-9ba6-1624e37e7b9c","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tuple"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以将一个序列转化为元组"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"11e4a4b0-1dd9-4552-9ee0-49c548a995ca","collabId":"54ceefa6-22b6-4867-ac78-e666c304cc8b","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":">>> tuple([1, 2, 3])\n(1, 2, 3)\n>>> tuple('abc')\n('a', 'b', 'c')\n>>> tuple((1, 2, 3))\n(1, 2, 3)"}],"tags":["Python/序列/元组"],"createTime":1719044062485,"updateTime":1791127188470,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791127188470}}